":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-04T16:55:56Z","updated_at":"2025-12-04T16:55:56Z","body":"I think it may be `String::simplify_path()` related. [Because it only removes `\"..\"` if it detects `\"/\"`.](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/78d91947f689ea9eb4049f4d6371c0dfcfa0e62f/core/string/ustring.cpp#L4191-L4205)\n\n| Path | Simplified | As expected IMHO | What it should be IMHO |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| `\"hello/world/..\"` | `\"hello\"` | ✅ | n/a |\n| `\"hello/..\"` | `\"\"` | ✅ | n/a |\n| `\"/..\"` | `\"/..\"` | ❌ | `\"/\"` |\n| `\"/../..\"` | `\"/../..\"` | ❌ | `\"/\"` |\n| `\"res://..\"` | `\"res://..\"` | ❌ | `\"res://\"` |\n| `\"res://../..\"` | `\"res://../..\"` | ❌ | `\"res://\"` |","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3613232343/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3613286742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113497#issuecomment-3613286742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113497","id":3613286742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XXmFW","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-04T17:05:37Z","updated_at":"2025-12-04T17:07:36Z","body":"Currently bisecting: cannot reproduce in Godot 4.6.dev4.\n_Edit: cannot also reproduce in Godot 4.6.dev5. I'm gonna Git bisect._","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3613286742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3613340934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113497#issuecomment-3613340934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113497","id":3613340934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XXzUG","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-04T17:14:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-04T17:14:44Z","body":"> cannot also reproduce in Godot 4.6.dev5. I'm gonna Git bisect.\n\nIt is reproducible with normal `FileDialog` in `4.6 dev5` (and in `4.5`), so this is a result of merging editor and base file dialogs (editor dialog likely had some extra code in it). Underlaying issue is in `simplify_path` and `fix_path`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3613340934/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3613846773","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113497#issuecomment-3613846773","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113497","id":3613846773,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XZuz1","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-04T18:47:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-04T18:47:27Z","body":"> I think it may be `String::simplify_path()` related. [Because it only removes `\"..\"` if it detects `\"/\"`.](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/78d91947f689ea9eb4049f4d6371c0dfcfa0e62f/core/string/ustring.cpp#L4191-L4205)\n> Path \tSimplified \tAs expected IMHO \tWhat it should be IMHO\n> `\"hello/world/..\"` \t`\"hello\"` \t✅ \tn/a\n> `\"hello/..\"` \t`\"\"` \t✅ \tn/a\n> `\"/..\"` \t`\"/..\"` \t❌ \t`\"/\"`\n> `\"/../..\"` \t`\"/../..\"` \t❌ \t`\"/\"`\n> `\"res://..\"` \t`\"res://..\"` \t❌ \t`\"res://\"`\n> `\"res://../..\"` \t`\"res://../..\"` \t❌ \t`\"res://\"`\n\nI'm not sure I agree with the expected results here.\n\n`simplify_path()` is meant to simplify paths, i.e. remove redundant parts, it's not meant to change the meaning/target of the path.\n\n`hello/world/..` and `hello` are indeed the same target, so that's correct.\n\n`/..` and `/` are not the same target AFAIK, whatever `/..` could be. If it's used to concatenate to a prefix, it would be invalid to remove `..`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3613846773/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3613859921","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113497#issuecomment-3613859921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113497","id":3613859921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XZyBR","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-04T18:50:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-04T18:50:35Z","body":"The better solution is probably to prevent the dialog from navigating in that way, at least as an immediate solution","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3613859921/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]